Description: key remapping tool for Linux using evdev and uinput
 Keymasq provides a privileged remapping daemon, a per-user session manager,
 and a GTK4 configuration interface for Linux input remapping.
 .
 It supports global layered profiles, macros, superkeys, combos, window-based
 profile activation, and desktop-specific window tracking integrations.
